.*
.* QTOCIFC: CFGTCP option 1, the IPv4 interfaces. WRKIFC has every
.* option, WRKIFCD only 5=Display (a profile without *IOSYSCFG), as
.* the system shows them; F11 steps through three views. DSPIFC is
.* option 5. A heading's blanks force its second row.
:PNLGRP.
:COPYR.(C) COPYRIGHT QUARTZ SYSTEMS 2026.
:CLASS NAME=OPTCL BASETYPE=ACTION.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=ADRCL BASETYPE='CHAR 15'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=NAMECL BASETYPE='CHAR 10'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=STSCL BASETYPE='CHAR 12'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=ALIASCL BASETYPE='CHAR 25'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=TEXTCL BASETYPE='CHAR 50'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=VALCL BASETYPE='CHAR 26'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=VIEWCL BASETYPE='CHAR 1'.
:ECLASS.
:VAR NAME=OPT CLASS=OPTCL.
:VAR NAME=IFCADR CLASS=ADRCL.
:VAR NAME=IFCMASK CLASS=ADRCL.
:VAR NAME=IFCLIND CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=IFCLTYPE CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=IFCSTS CLASS=STSCL.
:VAR NAME=IFCALIAS CLASS=ALIASCL.
:VAR NAME=IFCTEXT CLASS=TEXTCL.
:VAR NAME=VIEW CLASS=VIEWCL VALUE='1'.
:VAR NAME=DADR CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=DMASK CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=DLIND CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=DALIAS CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=DCCSID CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=DLTYPE CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=DLCLIFC CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=DSTS CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=DTOS CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=DMTU CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=DAUTO CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=DTEXT CLASS=TEXTCL.
:LISTDEF NAME=IFCS VARS='OPT IFCADR IFCMASK IFCLIND IFCLTYPE IFCSTS IFCALIAS IFCTEXT'.
:COND NAME=VIEW1 EXPR='&VIEW. EQ "1"'.
:COND NAME=VIEW2 EXPR='&VIEW. EQ "2"'.
:COND NAME=VIEW3 EXPR='&VIEW. EQ "3"'.
:KEYL NAME=WRKKEYS HELP='KEYS/WRKKEYS'.
:KEYI KEY=ENTER ACTION=ENTER.
:KEYI KEY=HELP ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=F1 ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=F3 ACTION=EXIT.F3=Exit
:KEYI KEY=F5 ACTION='RETURN 5'.F5=Refresh
:KEYI KEY=F6 ACTION='RETURN 6'.F6=Print list
:KEYI KEY=F11 ACTION='RETURN 11' COND=VIEW1.F11=Display interface status
:KEYI KEY=F11 ACTION='RETURN 11' COND=VIEW2.F11=Display text description
:KEYI KEY=F11 ACTION='RETURN 11' COND=VIEW3.F11=Display line information
:KEYI KEY=F12 ACTION=CANCEL.F12=Cancel
:KEYI KEY=F17 ACTION='RETURN 17'.F17=Top
:KEYI KEY=F18 ACTION='RETURN 18'.F18=Bottom
:KEYI KEY=PAGEUP ACTION=PAGEUP.
:KEYI KEY=PAGEDOWN ACTION=PAGEDOWN.
:EKEYL.
:KEYL NAME=DSPKEYS HELP='KEYS/DSPKEYS'.
:KEYI KEY=ENTER ACTION=ENTER.
:KEYI KEY=HELP ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=F1 ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=F3 ACTION=EXIT.F3=Exit
:KEYI KEY=F12 ACTION=CANCEL.F12=Cancel
:KEYI KEY=PAGEUP ACTION=PAGEUP.
:KEYI KEY=PAGEDOWN ACTION=PAGEDOWN.
:EKEYL.
:PANEL NAME=WRKIFC HELP=HLPIFC KEYL=WRKKEYS ENTER='RETURN 0' TOPSEP=SYSNAM BOTSEP=NONE.Work with TCP/IP Interfaces
:TOPINST.Type options, press Enter.
:LIST DEPTH='*' LISTDEF=IFCS SCROLL=YES VIEWS=3 EXTACT=YES.(No interfaces)
:LISTACT OPTION=1 ACTFOR=EXTACT ENTER='CMD ?ADDTCPIFC INTNETADR(''&IFCADR.'')' HELP='WRKIFC/OPTIONS'.1=Add
:LISTACT OPTION=2 ACTFOR=LISTE ENTER='CMD ?CHGTCPIFC INTNETADR(''&IFCADR.'')' HELP='WRKIFC/OPTIONS'.2=Change
:LISTACT OPTION=4 ACTFOR=LISTE ENTER='CMD RMVTCPIFC INTNETADR(''&IFCADR.'')' HELP='WRKIFC/OPTIONS'.4=Remove
:LISTACT OPTION=5 ACTFOR=LISTE ENTER='RETURN 105' HELP='WRKIFC/OPTIONS'.5=Display
:LISTACT OPTION=9 ACTFOR=LISTE ENTER='CMD STRTCPIFC INTNETADR(''&IFCADR.'')' HELP='WRKIFC/OPTIONS'.9=Start
:LISTACT OPTION=10 ACTFOR=LISTE ENTER='CMD ENDTCPIFC INTNETADR(''&IFCADR.'')' HELP='WRKIFC/OPTIONS'.10=End
:LISTCOL VAR=OPT USAGE=INPUT HELP='WRKIFC/OPT'.Opt
:LISTCOL VAR=IFCADR USAGE=OUTPUT EXTACT=YES HELP='FLD/IFCADR'.Internet Address
:LISTCOL VAR=IFCMASK USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/IFCMASK'.Subnet          Mask
:LISTCOL VAR=IFCLIND USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/IFCLIND'.Line Description
:LISTCOL VAR=IFCLTYPE USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/IFCLTYPE'.Line           Type
:LISTCOL VAR=IFCSTS USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/IFCSTS'.Interface Status
:LISTCOL VAR=IFCALIAS USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/IFCALIAS'.Alias                         Name
:LISTCOL VAR=IFCTEXT USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/IFCTEXT'.Text
:LISTVIEW COLS='OPT IFCADR IFCMASK IFCLIND IFCLTYPE'.
:LISTVIEW COLS='OPT IFCADR IFCMASK IFCSTS IFCALIAS'.
:LISTVIEW COLS='OPT IFCADR IFCMASK IFCTEXT'.
:ELIST.
:EPANEL.
:PANEL NAME=WRKIFCD HELP=HLPIFC KEYL=WRKKEYS ENTER='RETURN 0' TOPSEP=SYSNAM BOTSEP=NONE.Work with TCP/IP Interfaces
:TOPINST.Type options, press Enter.
:LIST DEPTH='*' LISTDEF=IFCS SCROLL=YES VIEWS=3 EXTACT=YES.(No interfaces)
:LISTACT OPTION=5 ACTFOR=LISTE ENTER='RETURN 105' HELP='WRKIFCD/OPTIONS'.5=Display
:LISTCOL VAR=OPT USAGE=INPUT HELP='WRKIFCD/OPT'.Opt
:LISTCOL VAR=IFCADR USAGE=OUTPUT EXTACT=YES HELP='FLD/IFCADR'.Internet Address
:LISTCOL VAR=IFCMASK USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/IFCMASK'.Subnet          Mask
:LISTCOL VAR=IFCLIND USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/IFCLIND'.Line Description
:LISTCOL VAR=IFCLTYPE USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/IFCLTYPE'.Line           Type
:LISTCOL VAR=IFCSTS USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/IFCSTS'.Interface Status
:LISTCOL VAR=IFCALIAS USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/IFCALIAS'.Alias                         Name
:LISTCOL VAR=IFCTEXT USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/IFCTEXT'.Text
:LISTVIEW COLS='OPT IFCADR IFCMASK IFCLIND IFCLTYPE'.
:LISTVIEW COLS='OPT IFCADR IFCMASK IFCSTS IFCALIAS'.
:LISTVIEW COLS='OPT IFCADR IFCMASK IFCTEXT'.
:ELIST.
:EPANEL.
:PANEL NAME=DSPIFC HELP=HLPDSP KEYL=DSPKEYS ENTER='RETURN 0' TOPSEP=SYSNAM.Display TCP/IP Interface
:DATA DEPTH='*' SCROLL=IND.
:DATACOL WIDTH=48.
:DATACOL WIDTH=78.
:DATAI VAR=DADR USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/DADR'.Internet address
:DATAI VAR=DMASK USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/DMASK'.Subnet mask
:DATAI VAR=DLIND USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/DLIND'.Line description
:DATAI VAR=DALIAS USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/DALIAS'.Alias name
:DATAI VAR=DCCSID USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/DCCSID'.Alias name CCSID
:DATAI VAR=DLTYPE USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/DLTYPE'.Line type
:DATAI VAR=DLCLIFC USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/DLCLIFC'.Associated local interface
:DATAI VAR=DSTS USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/DSTS'.Interface status
:DATAI VAR=DTOS USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/DTOS'.Type of service
:DATAI VAR=DMTU USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/DMTU'.Maximum transmission unit
:DATAI VAR=DAUTO USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/DAUTO'.Automatic start
:DATAI VAR=DTEXT USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/DTEXT'.Text description
:EDATA.
:BOTINST.Press Enter to continue.
:EPANEL.
:HELP NAME=HLPIFC.Work with TCP/IP Interfaces - Help
:P.The IPv4 interfaces in address order: each address, its mask and the
line it runs on. F11 shows their status and alias names, then their text.
Type an option next to an interface to change, remove, display, start or
end it; option 1 adds one.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME=HLPDSP.Display TCP/IP Interface - Help
:P.One interface's configuration and its status now.
:EHELP.
.* Item, key and option help.
:HELP NAME='KEYS/WRKKEYS'.Function keys
:PARML.
:PT.F3=Exit
:PD.Ends the display and returns to where it was started from.
:PT.F5=Refresh
:PD.Shows the display again with the current information.
:PT.F6=Print list
:PD.Print list.
:PT.F11=Display interface status
:PD.Display interface status.
:PT.F11=Display text description
:PD.Display text description.
:PT.F11=Display line information
:PD.Display line information.
:PT.F12=Cancel
:PD.Returns to the previous display without acting on what was typed.
:PT.F17=Top
:PD.Moves to the top of the list.
:PT.F18=Bottom
:PD.Moves to the bottom of the list.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='WRKIFC/OPT'.Option
:P.Type the number of an option next to an entry and press Enter. The
options the list allows are shown above it; F1 on one of them explains
it.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/IFCADR'.Internet Address
:P.An internet address in dotted decimal form (IPv4) or in colon form
(IPv6).
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/IFCMASK'.Subnet          Mask
:P.The subnet Mask of each entry in the list.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/IFCLIND'.Line Description
:P.The line description.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/IFCLTYPE'.Line           Type
:P.The line Type of each entry in the list.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/IFCSTS'.Interface Status
:P.The interface Status of each entry in the list.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/IFCALIAS'.Alias                         Name
:P.The alias Name of each entry in the list.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/IFCTEXT'.Text
:P.The text of each entry in the list.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='WRKIFC/OPTIONS'.Options
:P.Type an option number next to one or more entries and press Enter.
The option runs for each entry it is typed next to, in order.
:PARML.
:PT.1=Add
:PD.Type 1 next to an entry and press Enter to add it. The Add TCP/IP
Interface (ADDTCPIFC) command is prompted for the entry.
:PT.2=Change
:PD.Type 2 next to an entry and press Enter to change it. The Change
TCP/IP Interface (CHGTCPIFC) command is prompted for the entry.
:PT.4=Remove
:PD.Type 4 next to an entry and press Enter to remove it. The Remove
TCP/IP Interface (RMVTCPIFC) command runs for the entry.
:PT.5=Display
:PD.Type 5 next to an entry and press Enter to display it.
:PT.9=Start
:PD.Type 9 next to an entry and press Enter to start it. The Start
TCP/IP Interface (STRTCPIFC) command runs for the entry.
:PT.10=End
:PD.Type 10 next to an entry and press Enter to end it. The End TCP/IP
Interface (ENDTCPIFC) command runs for the entry.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='WRKIFCD/OPT'.Option
:P.Type the number of an option next to an entry and press Enter. The
options the list allows are shown above it; F1 on one of them explains
it.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='WRKIFCD/OPTIONS'.Options
:P.Type an option number next to one or more entries and press Enter.
The option runs for each entry it is typed next to, in order.
:PARML.
:PT.5=Display
:PD.Type 5 next to an entry and press Enter to display it.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='KEYS/DSPKEYS'.Function keys
:PARML.
:PT.F3=Exit
:PD.Ends the display and returns to where it was started from.
:PT.F12=Cancel
:PD.Returns to the previous display without acting on what was typed.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/DADR'.Internet address
:P.An internet address in dotted decimal form (IPv4) or in colon form
(IPv6).
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/DMASK'.Subnet mask
:P.The subnet mask that tells the network part of the address from the
host part.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/DLIND'.Line description
:P.The line description.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/DALIAS'.Alias name
:P.The alias name shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/DCCSID'.Alias name CCSID
:P.The alias name CCSID shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/DLTYPE'.Line type
:P.The line type shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/DLCLIFC'.Associated local interface
:P.The associated local interface shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/DSTS'.Interface status
:P.The interface status shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/DTOS'.Type of service
:P.The type of service shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/DMTU'.Maximum transmission unit
:P.The maximum transmission unit shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/DAUTO'.Automatic start
:P.The automatic start shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/DTEXT'.Text description
:P.The text description shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:EPNLGRP.
